<Layout title="Drylining Dalkeith | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Dalkeith. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Dalkeith, Midlothian, and the wider EH22 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/dalkeith/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Dalkeith and Midlothian" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Dalkeith</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Dalkeith</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Dalkeith, Midlothian, and the wider EH22 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Dalkeith provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Dalkeith (EH22), Midlothian, and the wider area. Experienced with historic townhouse conversions, new residential developments, and rural property refurbishments.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Dalkeith</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Dalkeith is a charming royal burgh in Midlothian, situated approximately 8 miles south-east of Edinburgh city centre. The EH22 postcode covers a mix of the historic town centre with its distinctive 18th-century architecture, surrounding residential areas, and nearby countryside villages. Dalkeith is home to Dalkeith Palace, Dalkeith Country Park, and the Water of Leith, making it one of Midlothian's most desirable places to live. The town has a population of around 18,000 and serves as the administrative centre for Midlothian Council. As a commuter town for Edinburgh, Dalkeith has seen steady residential development alongside the ongoing preservation and refurbishment of its heritage property stock, creating consistent demand for quality drylining services.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The area offers a distinctive mix of projects for our drylining team — from the careful internal refurbishment of listed townhouses in Dalkeith's historic centre to new build residential developments on the town's outskirts. We cover the entire EH22 postcode and surrounding Midlothian areas, serving everything from single-room domestic projects in period properties to larger commercial fit-outs along Dalkeith's business corridors. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Dalkeith</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Dalkeith crew handles everything from historic townhouse room conversions to new build pre-completion drylining — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the EH22 postcode and Midlothian.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>Historic property drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in Dalkeith's listed 18th and 19th-century townhouses</li> <li><strong>New build drylining</strong> — Pre-completion drylining for residential developments on the outskirts of Dalkeith and surrounding Midlothian areas</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbs, retail units, and hospitality venues along Dalkeith town centre and business areas</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, and new build apartments across Midlothian</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties and student housing in Dalkeith and surrounding areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Dalkeith We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Dalkeith town centre (EH22)</li> <li>Dalkeith Palace and Park area</li> <li>Alton Terrace and the Old Dalkeith Road area</li> <li>Whitehill area (EH22)</li> <li>Milnfield and Dalkeith Newton</li> <li>Newtongrange (EH22) — adjacent to Dalkeith</li> <li>Penicuik (EH26) — 10 minutes via A709</li> <li>Midlothian area generally</li> <li>Lothian Park area and EH22 surroundings</li> <li>Dalkeith Rural and countryside properties</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Dalkeith Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Dalkeith falls under <strong>Midlothian Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The town centre contains numerous Category A and B listed buildings, including properties near Dalkeith Palace that are within conservation areas. Internal structural alterations in listed buildings require listed building consent from the council. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a simple room partition in a historic townhouse to a commercial fit-out in a new build — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any additional conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Dalkeith Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across Midlothian, including Dalkeith, Penicuik, and Newtongrange. We understand the unique character of Dalkeith — from its historic town centre with its distinctive architecture to the growing residential developments on the town's fringes. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in a historic Scottish burgh. Whether you need drylining for a listed townhouse conversion in Dalkeith centre, a new build project, or a commercial refurbishment, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh</a> — 15 minutes via A702</li> <li><a href="/areas/penicuik/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Penicuik</a> — 10 minutes via A709</li> <li><a href="/areas/newtongrange/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Newtongrange</a> — 10 minutes via A68</li> <li><a href="/areas/musselburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Musselburgh</a> — 20 minutes via A703</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Dalkeith Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Dalkeith. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-quote/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;">Get a Free Dalkeith Quote</a> <a href="tel:08008203090" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:transparent;color:var(--primary);margin-left:0.5rem;">FREEPHONE 0800 820 3090</a> </div> </div></section>  
